  "name": "Smart Building + Data Centre",
  "category": "mixed",
  "description": "Office building with an on-site data centre. BMS-SUP: Niagara supervisor, Desigo CC and two Tridium JACE-8000s; BMS-FIELD: JCI Metasys FEC2611 and Siemens Desigo PXC5 controllers on BACnet/IP (ReadProperty polls, Who-Is/I-Am + device-object reads, SubscribeCOV + COV notifications) and a Siemens KNX IP router serving a KNX visualisation (KNXnet/IP search, description, routing indications). DC-POWER: APC Smart-UPS (NMC3), APC AP8853 and Raritan PX3 rack PDUs polled over SNMP by the DCIM, Vertiv Liebert CW CRAH units and Carrier 30XA chillers plus Schneider PM5560 meters on Modbus/TCP (polls + FC43 device ID) from the BMS server. SECURITY: Axis and Hikvision IP cameras pulled by the VMS over HTTP, Mercury LP4502 access controllers talking TLS to the access-control server. GUEST-WIFI: phones/laptops with randomised (locally administered) MACs browsing the internet. Planted findings: (1) default SNMP community — every poll uses 'public' (switches 'private'); (2) Hikvision camera CAM-10 phoning home to its P2P cloud (external HIK-CLOUD, 34.246.112.25) after a DNS lookup; (3) BMS reachable from guest Wi-Fi — GUEST-03 opens the JACE-01 web UI and runs BACnet device discovery against it. Periods: BACnet polls 5 s, COV pushes 30 s, Modbus 5 s, SNMP 60 s, camera pulls 10 s, KNX routing 2 s.",
